This paper presents the conference 
\emph{Grapholinguistics in the 21st Century}
that was to take place in Paris, in June~2020. With the global
health situation, it will now be held as a video conference
(\url{https://grafematik2020.sciencesconf.org}). We give an introduction
to the discipline of grapholinguistics, the history and the topics of
the conference, and we close with the fundamental question: why should a
\TeX\ user join the conference?

Originally written for \textsl{MAPS} 50 (2020). Reprinted with permission.
